Retrieve raws of the DL CSI RS Send Req Event on given trsInfo
    [Documentation]     Filter DL csi-rs for tracking (trsInfo=1) or DL csi-rs for Acquisition (trsInfo=0)
    [Arguments]      ${file_name}       ${trsInfo}
    BuiltIn.Log      ${file_name}      console=yes
    ${data} =  OperatingSystem.Get File    ${file_name}
    ${Top_row} =  Get Line    ${data}    0
    ${file_path_Dl_CsiSendReqEvent_trsInfo} =    set variable        ${sherpa_output_path}/tcpdump/Dl_CsiRsSendReqEvent_${trsInfo}.csv
    Set Suite Variable    ${file_path_Dl_CsiSendReqEvent_trsInfo}
    ${Dl_CsiRsSendReqEvent_13_trsInfo} =    Get Lines Containing String     ${data}   ${trsInfo}
    Append To File     ${file_path_Dl_CsiSendReqEvent_trsInfo}    ${Top_row}\n
    Append To File     ${file_path_Dl_CsiSendReqEvent_trsInfo}    ${Dl_CsiRsSendReqEvent_13_trsInfo}\n

Calling Panda Extract Csv function CsiRs
      Dated Log New Line     Calling Panda Extract Csv function CsiRs
      ${file_path_Dl_CsiSendReqEvent} =      set variable    ${sherpa_output_path}/tcpdump/Dl_CsiRsSendReqEvent_${trsInfo_1}.csv
      Dated Log New Line     input Panda extract function is ${file_path_Dl_CsiSendReqEvent}
      Dated Log New Line     input Panda extract function is ${sherpa_output_path}/tcpdump/Dl_CsiRsSendReqEvent_${trsInfo_1}.csv
      PandasCsv.Setup Reader     ${file_path_Dl_CsiSendReqEvent}    # Load data from a csv file using pandas library
      PandasCsv.extract_cvs_files_forcolumn    filter_column=TEXT    by_value=MSGID    filter=CsiRsSendReqEvent(13)
      ...                                      list_grp=None    csv_sep=;


Set RAD Params Of 8940
    [Documentation]     Add or Modify the RAD params of 8940 To Activate the feature
    ...                 will be replaced later by NIDD params
    ...                 0x580117=1 : #CSI-RS Event Sherpa
    ...                 0x420062=1 : new cell slot model
    ...                 0x590191=1 : rdSlowPrbPoolingTddFr1UseHardcodedTrackingCsiRs
    ...                 0x420068=000 : rdTddPoolingFeaturesEnable default value is 111
    ...                              Binary 3 bits LSB bit0->CB8940; bit1->CB008847; bit2->CB007113
    ...                              0 disable; 1 enable features can be activated independantly
    ...                 0x590190=1 : rdActSlowPrbPoolingTddFr1Dl
    ...                 0x58057A=4 : L2 feature flags : ERR & WRN & INF & DBG
    ...                 0x58057C=0x3800 : rdFeatureFlagBitmap1
    ...                     bit 11 - PRB_POOLING.BASIC,
    ...                     bit 12   PRB_POOLING.DL,
    ...                     bit 13 - PRB_POOLING.UL ==> binary 0011 1000 0000 0000
    ...                 0x5901C0=1 : rdEnableBBL1SpPrbInitCapacity
    ...                 0x580690=0  # rdAllowZeroAllocByPass - 0 : ZAB Disabled - 1 : Enabled
    ...                 0x58066a=0  # InterL1SubPool         - 0 : Disabled - 1 : Enabled
    ...                 0x420080=0  #rdTddSubCellDeactEnable - 0 : Disabled - 1 : Enabled

    Dated Log New Line   Add RAD params of 8940 ......
    ${rad_param_1}=      create dictionary       field=0x580117    value=1
    ${rad_param_2}=      create dictionary       field=0x420068    value=3
    ${rad_param_3}=      create dictionary       field=0x580690    value=0
    ${rad_param_4}=      create dictionary       field=0x58066a    value=0
    ${rad_param_5}=      create dictionary       field=0x420080    value=0

    ${rad_param_list}=       Create List         ${rad_param_1}
    ...                                          ${rad_param_2}
    ...                                          ${rad_param_3}
    ...                                          ${rad_param_4}
    ...                                          ${rad_param_5}

    Dated Log New Line    RAD params :  ${rad_param_list}
    SetConfig.Set Fields in swconfig DU       param_list=${rad_param_list}
    Dated Log New Line   RAD params of 8940 update completed

Start Capture on ASIB CPRT Container
    ${CaptureCPRT_ASIB}             Capture CPRT Set Upon Config    airscale=${GNB_DU}
    # ${CaptureCPRT_ASIB.filter}      Run Keyword If      'SBTS22R3' in '${TLConfig.topo.gnbVersion}'
    # ...                                                  Set Variable       Get Filter For SCTP
    # ...                             ELSE
    # ...                                                  Set Variable       Get Filter For TCP
    Set Suite Variable              ${CaptureCPRT_ASIB}
    Capture Init                    ${CaptureCPRT_ASIB}
    Capture Start                   ${CaptureCPRT_ASIB}

Stop Capture on ASIB CPRT Container
    Capture Stop    ${CaptureCPRT_ASIB}

Multi Cells Setup 8940
    [Arguments]       ${nbCell}
    ${msgStr}=    Catenate  Test ${nbCell} Cells Setup
    Dated Log   ${msgStr}
    Setup Wtsemu SA
    sleep    60s
    WTS Set X2 Link
    sleep    5s
   # WTS Testmode Decode PDSCH On SSB Slot

WTS Testmode Decode PDSCH On SSB Slot
    wtsemu.ue_testmode_decode_muxphychan    decode_mux_phy_chan=decode_PDSCH
    sleep    2s

Recommissioning
    Oam.OAM Perform Full Commissioning       scf_file=${SCF_SETUP_PATH}
    WA Airscale Wait For Ready               ${GNB_DU}

End Of TC Teardown
   [Documentation]        At the end of each TC :
   ...                      - prepare Scout data
   ...                      - show the Diagnosis of the TC steps
   ...                      - collect the gnb Snapshot
   ...                      - if TC failed, collect also AP sosReport

   Dated Log              End Of TC : start
   Produce Scout Data
   Oam.OAM Get Snapshot
   # Run Keyword If Test Failed     Setup.Get Sos Report
   GenericTest.Display Diagnosis
   Dated Log              End of TC : end


